  geneva: 'The Geneva Spur — the black rock buttress. The South Col is just over the top.',
  triangular: 'The Triangular Face. A long, steep climb in the dark to the Balcony.',
  balcony: 'The Balcony, 8,400 m, on the Southeast Ridge. Change bottles here if you need to.',
  southsummit: 'The South Summit, 8,749 m. Ahead: the cornice traverse along the knife-edge ridge.',
